1597873792282,"type":"genre","name":"Chicago House","n":1},{"id":79811058028299,"type":"genre","name":"Plunderphonics","n":1},{"id":53539792878345,"type":"genre","name":"Nu-Disco","n":1},{"id":48431972897055,"type":"genre","name":"Ambient House","n":1}],"labels":[],"album_labels":[],"own_scenes":[],"scenes":[{"id":70602249889008,"name":"Ambient house e IDM","book":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","start":1989,"end":1999,"desc":"Música para relajarse en las «chill-out rooms» que se convierte en género propio, entre el techno y el minimalismo: Chill Out de KLF es su manifiesto; Irresistible Force, Orb (Adventures Beyond The Ultraworld, U.F. Orb: el DJ convertido en compositor clásico), Ultramarine, Global Communication, Spacetime Continuum, Banco De Gaia, Woob. La «Intelligent Dance Music»: Orbital (Brown Album), Eat Static, Sabres Of Paradise, Future Sound Of London, Black Dog, Leftfield, Richard James / Aphex Twin, Plastikman, Moby, Vapourspace. Y la música de baile para no bailarines: Scanner, Faithless, Lo-Fidelity Allstars, Luke Slater, Christian Vogel, David Holmes, Susumu Yokota.","color":"#2dd4bf","family":"Vanguardia, electrónica y ambient","link":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/#ambient-house"}],"book_tracks":[{"id":121319319496546,"artist":"Susumu Yokota","artist_id":25201660223655,"title":"Cat Mouse And Me","year":1996,"ess":0,"yt":"hYiG57ZKAxY","kind":"a","book":{"id":8,"title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","url":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/"},"scene":"Ambient house e IDM","scene_id":70602249889008,"scene_link":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/#ambient-house","chapters":["Sección 6.9"],"pages":[[1,266,null]]},{"id":184163659463569,"artist":"Susumu Yokota","artist_id":25201660223655,"title":"Magic Thread","year":1998,"ess":0,"yt":"BHdF4rTVLWE","kind":"a","book":{"id":8,"title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","url":"https://volteret4.github.io/sca